  "releaseNotes": "RELEASE NOTES:\n=================\nThe UI library for building fast and beautiful apps in WinForms, .NET, C#, VB.NET and Visual Studio IDE.\n\n* IMPORTANT PLEASE READ:\n- Back up all your projects BEFORE updating.\n- Read about the changes, enhancements and improvements BEFORE updating.\n- Contact us if you have any questions BEFORE updating your library.\n------------------------------\n\nENHANCED COMPONENTS:\n# Siticone Dashboard Card\n# Siticone Button Advanced\n\n\n🔥NEW COMPONENTS:\n# Siticone Overlay Component\n# Siticone Spotlight Component\n# Siticone Expandable Calendar\n# Siticone Aero Gauge\n# Siticone Chrono Gauge\n# Siticone Badge System Notification\n# Siticone Material Star Rating\n# Siticone Material Tile Button\n# Siticone Material Tile Button Advanced\n# Siticone Material Group Box\n# Siticone Advanced Line Chart\n# Siticone Aura Group Box\n# Siticone Nova Group Box\n# Siticone Legacy Group Box\n# Siticone Status Bar\n# Siticone Nova Pulse Tile\n# Siticone Button Textbox\n# Siticone Text Button Advanced\n# Siticone Clock\n# Siticone Fusion Clock\n# Siticone Orbital Clock\n# Siticone Celestial Clock\n# Siticone Digital Arc Clock\n# Siticone Analog Clock\n# Siticone Digital Clock\n# Siticone Hybrid Clock\n# Siticone Stopwatch\n# Siticone Color Picker\n# Siticone Global Event Handler\n# Siticone Checkbox Advanced\n# Siticone Pips Pager\n# Siticone Slide View\n# Siticone Collapsible Panel\n# Siticone Linear Bar Gauge",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
